A terminated `/* ... */` banner before the directives is masked out of the
header so hybrid detection still applies at unshifted positions
(feature.diagnostics_pipeline A17). datasource_default_required fires in
the SQL-mode header: each name without an inline `:=` default reports an
error ranged on the name, on the header's own line (proving positions are
unshifted), and the defaulted name between them is silent. STARLIMS 12
fails such a run with "No default value for one or more parameters." The
maintainer once believed `:PARAMETERS p1;` was accepted; the catalog
entry (reinstated in #263/#269) is the current authority. The banner and
the SQL body report nothing.
-- input.ds --
/* ==========================================
   Data source: open returns by warehouse
   ========================================== */
:DSN := DATABASE;
:PARAMETERS sWarehouse, nMinAge := 1, nMaxAge;

SELECT r.return_id, r.opened_on
FROM goods_return r
WHERE r.warehouse_code = @sWarehouse
  AND r.age_days BETWEEN @nMinAge AND @nMaxAge
-- format --
/* ==========================================
   Data source: open returns by warehouse
   ========================================== */
:DSN := DATABASE;
:PARAMETERS sWarehouse, nMinAge := 1, nMaxAge;

SELECT r.return_id, r.opened_on
FROM goods_return r
WHERE r.warehouse_code = @sWarehouse
  AND r.age_days BETWEEN @nMinAge AND @nMaxAge
-- diagnostics --
5:13-5:23 error datasource_default_required: Data source parameter 'sWarehouse' needs an inline ':=' default; without one the data source fails when it runs (No default value for one or more parameters)
5:39-5:46 error datasource_default_required: Data source parameter 'nMaxAge' needs an inline ':=' default; without one the data source fails when it runs (No default value for one or more parameters)
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
5:13-5:23 error datasource_default_required: Data source parameter 'sWarehouse' needs an inline ':=' default; without one the data source fails when it runs (No default value for one or more parameters)
5:39-5:46 error datasource_default_required: Data source parameter 'nMaxAge' needs an inline ':=' default; without one the data source fails when it runs (No default value for one or more parameters)
